{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Nowhere Station* is a cooperative simulation game set in a train station for souls who can no longer remain in the world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo lets you experience a part of that world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a single-player session of about 10 minutes on the ground floor of the station. Two roles are available: **Cleaning** and **Repair**. Remove contamination, fix broken facilities, and keep the station running smoothly.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Included in this demo**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Single-player only  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- One session (~10 minutes)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Playable roles: Cleaning, Repair  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Core mechanics: contamination removal and facility repair  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ground floor area  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Not included in this demo**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiplayer / Co-op  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ticketing and Security roles  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Progression or upgrades  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Upper floors of the station  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4059410?t=1760053174","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4059410?t=1760053174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059410/0e606b2fdcc08b2dbfd703c8700976ba473743b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760053174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059410/0e606b2fdcc08b2dbfd703c8700976ba473743b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760053174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Nowhere Station* is a cooperative simulation game set in a train station for souls who can no longer remain in the world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo lets you experience a part of that world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a single-player session of about 10 minutes on the ground floor of the station. Two roles are available: **Cleaning** and **Repair**. Remove contamination, fix broken facilities, and keep the station running smoothly.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Included in this demo**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Single-player only  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- One session (~10 minutes)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Playable roles: Cleaning, Repair  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Core mechanics: contamination removal and facility repair  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ground floor area  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Not included in this demo**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiplayer / Co-op  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ticketing and Security roles  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Progression or upgrades  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Upper floors of the station  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["BYEONGHO PARK","CHANGMIN KANG ","JAESUNG HAN","GYUBIN KIM","DONGHYUK KIM","INYONG CHOI"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4038980","name":"Nowhere Station"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059410/675f5b463890d5de70b2172a3f90b0a1f725ce2b/header.jpg?t=1760053174","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4059410/1036451656/1e652b63402592eaa3f535e24a19a72c373e9f8a/1758757316/das